Package: pam
Type: Package
Title: Presence-Absence Matrix Construction from Species Range Maps
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Angel", "Robles",
           email = "a.l.robles.fernandez@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4559-1751"))
Description: Constructs geographic presence-absence matrices (PAMs) from
    species range polygons stored as 'terra' SpatVector objects.
    Rasterizes vector geometries onto a user-defined grid and pivots the
    result into a sites-by-species binary matrix suitable for biodiversity
    analyses.  Includes convenience functions to retrieve example mammal
    range data and WorldClim environmental layers projected to two
    dimensions via Principal Component Analysis.
